    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNestled in the heart of Greystones, this delightful three-bedroom cottage offers the perfect blend of timeless character with an unbeatable location. Just minutes from the harbour and seafront, this charming home provides an exceptional opportunity to enjoy an idyllic coastal location. \n\nExtending to 872 sq.ft. approx. the cottage offers bright, comfortable accommodation. The three bedrooms provide flexible space for families, guests, or a home office, while the welcoming living area creates the perfect setting for relaxing or entertaining. The kitchen/dining has a solid fuel Aga and a picturesque window seat.\nDating back to the mid 1800's, full of olde world charm and character, this home presents an opportunity to enjoy cottage living while adding your own personal style over time.\n\nJust a stones throw from the marina and a short stroll to the vibrant town centre, the location of Tara Cottage is hard to beat. It has that real 'fall in love' factor and is bound to appeal to first time buyers and anyone looking for a more manageable home in a super convenient location.\n\nOutside:\nWhite picket fence to the front with an array of plants and bushes. A small private sunny westerly terrace to the rear is the perfect spot to relax and enjoy the afternoon and evening sunshine."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - \nTiled floor, wooden wall panelling\n\nLiving Room - \nLaminate flooring, open period fireplace, window to the front, wood panelled ceiling.\n\nBedroom 1 - \nLaminate flooring, window to side, fitted wardrobes, whb with understorage.\n\nKitchen/Dining - \nTiled flooring, range of fitted kitchen units, solid fuel Aga, understairs storage, wall panelling, stainless steel sink unit, stairs to mezzanine bedroom, window seat overlooking front.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nLaminate flooring, wood panelled ceiling, fitted shelving, window to front. Door to rear hallway.\n\nShower Room - \nTiled floor, wc, whb, fitted mirrored wall cabinet, Mira shower, fully tiled around shower, window to rear.\n\nBedroom 3 - \nMezzanine bedroom with fitted storage, laminate flooring, window to side.\n\nRear Hall/Utility Area - \nTiled floor, fitted storage units, door to outside.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Character-filled cottage with period features</li><li> Private outdoor westerly courtyard to the rear</li><li> Situated in the heart of Greystones town</li><li> Just a short stroll to the harbour, beach, cafés, restaurants, and boutique shops</li><li> Excellent transport links, including DART and easy access to Dublin</ul>"
      },
